# 🚼 DevPulse – Internal Issue Tracker API

A backend API for reporting bugs and feature requests with role-based access control.

##  Tech Stack
- Node.js + Express.js
- TypeScript
- PostgreSQL (raw SQL only)
- JWT Authentication
- bcrypt for password hashing

## Roles
- **contributor**: create, view, update own issues
- **maintainer**: full access (update/delete any issue)

##  Auth
- JWT-based authentication
- Token sent via `Authorization` header

##Main Endpoints

### Auth
- POST `/api/auth/signup`
- POST `/api/auth/login`

### Issues
- POST `/api/issues` (create issue)
- GET `/api/issues` (get all issues)
- GET `/api/issues/:id` (single issue)
- PATCH `/api/issues/:id` (update issue)
- DELETE `/api/issues/:id` (maintainer only)

## Database
- users
- issues

## Features
- Role-based access control
- Secure password hashing
- JWT protected routes
- Issue tracking workflow (open → in_progress → resolved)

## ⚡ Setup
```bash
npm install
npm run dev
